00:52:21,930 --> 00:52:24,307
What did you do with
Rachel? Or is it Cassie?

780
00:52:26,726 --> 00:52:28,103
I'm five minutes away.

781
00:52:28,186 --> 00:52:29,521
Hang up the phone.

782
00:52:29,604 --> 00:52:30,897
- Doug...
- Hang it up

783
00:52:30,981 --> 00:52:32,482
or you'll never hear from me again.

784
00:52:33,316 --> 00:52:34,568
I'll come to you.

785
00:52:47,164 --> 00:52:48,164
Nathan,

786
00:52:48,748 --> 00:52:50,125
are you still listening?

787
00:52:52,127 --> 00:52:54,254
You're a fool to think
she'll protect you.

788
00:53:03,346 --> 00:53:05,515
Seems fitting, somehow,

789
00:53:05,599 --> 00:53:09,561
that you're the first person I meet
with after I've returned to work.

790
00:53:10,645 --> 00:53:12,814
There's something very
full circle about it.

791
00:53:13,648 --> 00:53:15,775
So, you've talked to your son.

792
00:53:15,859 --> 00:53:18,528
Or rather, not your son.

793
00:53:19,571 --> 00:53:22,657
Do you know how developed
a fetus is by then?

794
00:53:23,491 --> 00:53:25,118
Sixteen weeks is...

795
00:53:26,286 --> 00:53:27,913
beyond the beyond.

796
00:53:32,626 --> 00:53:34,836
That is what 16 weeks looks like.

797
00:53:34,920 --> 00:53:37,422
That is what I can't get out of my head.

798
00:53:38,006 --> 00:53:40,675
I'm quoting Melody
Cruz here, by the way.

799
00:53:40,759 --> 00:53:43,470
She just taped her segment,
due to run tomorrow.

800
00:53:44,179 --> 00:53:45,597
Visual aids and everything.

801
00:53:47,140 --> 00:53:49,893
For the first time ever,
Americans will hear the story

802
00:53:49,976 --> 00:53:51,061
of a childless president...

803
00:53:52,395 --> 00:53:53,647
who had an abortion,

804
00:53:54,231 --> 00:53:55,440
while married,

805
00:53:55,941 --> 00:53:57,859
at 16 weeks.

806
00:53:58,735 --> 00:54:00,737
I wanted to see your face.

807
00:54:00,820 --> 00:54:03,573
I wanted to see Frank's
betrayal register.

808
00:54:03,949 --> 00:54:06,952
Nobody can keep their
mouths shut these days.

809
00:54:07,285 --> 00:54:09,329
Not even to-the-death secrets are safe.

810
00:54:09,412 --> 00:54:10,580
It's shameful.

811
00:54:11,957 --> 00:54:13,792
But honestly, what's worse?

812
00:54:14,125 --> 00:54:15,877
That he betrayed your secret

813
00:54:15,961 --> 00:54:18,338
or that you waited until 16 weeks?

814
00:54:18,421 --> 00:54:19,839
You and your party.

815
00:54:20,423 --> 00:54:23,301
Your moral rectitude, how convenient.

816
00:54:23,385 --> 00:54:26,012
You don't even believe half
of what you say, Annette.

817
00:54:26,680 --> 00:54:27,680
Run it.

818
00:54:28,014 --> 00:54:29,266
Cruz's piece.

819
00:54:29,724 --> 00:54:30,767
Run it.

820
00:54:31,810 --> 00:54:33,645
And then go home

821
00:54:34,020 --> 00:54:36,648
and talk to Duncan about
the beginning of life.

822
00:54:38,233 --> 00:54:39,943
But actually before you go,

823
00:54:40,026 --> 00:54:42,362
I want to show you
something. Come with me.

824
00:54:59,587 --> 00:55:01,464
Meet my new cabinet.

825
00:55:04,801 --> 00:55:06,761
I just wanted to see your face.

826
00:55:16,730 --> 00:55:20,108
Thank you all for assembling
at such short notice.

827
00:55:21,234 --> 00:55:22,986
And I want to thank you

828
00:55:23,528 --> 00:55:25,530
for your willingness to serve.

829
00:55:26,823 --> 00:55:30,493
I am looking forward to
building a new America together

830
00:55:31,202 --> 00:55:33,663
and our work begins today.

831
00:55:35,248 --> 00:55:36,708
Now, if you could all

832
00:55:36,791 --> 00:55:39,419
place your left hand on the Constitution

833
00:55:39,502 --> 00:55:40,754
in front of you.

834
00:55:42,047 --> 00:55:43,715
And repeat after me:

835
00:55:43,798 --> 00:55:46,509
I do solemnly swear

836
00:55:47,302 --> 00:55:49,471
to take no prisoners.

837
00:55:55,000 --> 00:56:00,000
